{
 "encounter_id": "00967",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Doctor, please, I have a terrible headache. It came on suddenly, about thirty minutes ago, while I was lifting weights at the gym. It's the worst headache of my life."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'm taking this very seriously. Where is it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "At the back of my head, like a blow. It reached the worst in seconds, I have never had anything like it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you have any neck pain or stiffness?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, my neck is stiff and sore. I can't put my chin down."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you feel sick?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Very nauseous. I vomited once in the car park."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Did you hit your head, or have an injury?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, no injury. I did not hit my head."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you have any allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Penicillin, I developed a rash."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll note that. What do you do for work?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I am a software developer."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check your numbers quickly. Blood pressure 168 over 98, pulse 92, temperature 36.9, oxygen 98 percent, breathing 18.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that serious? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's raised, from the pain. Now, please touch your chin to your chest.",
   "pause": 8.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I cannot. It's very painful. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your neck is stiff when I bend it forward."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, that is exactly it. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And your pupils are equal and react to light."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That is a relief. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me tell you what I'm thinking. A sudden, severe headache like this can be a bleed around the brain, called a subarachnoid haemorrhage. I can't rule that out, and I won't take any risks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Oh my God. Is that likely? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's not the most likely cause, but it's the one we must exclude. I'd like to arrange a CT scan of your head, right now."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Of course. Anything. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If the CT scan is normal, I might do a lumbar puncture, a test of the fluid around the spine, because the scan can miss small bleeds."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that painful? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Uncomfortable, but quick. I'd also like to do blood tests, including a clotting profile."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I will do whatever you need. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Please lie flat, and don't eat or drink anything until we have the scan."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, doctor. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If the headache gets worse, or you become drowsy or confused, tell the nurse immediately."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I will. Thank you for taking this seriously. ~"
  }
 ],
